    <code code="42349-1" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Reason for referral (narrative)"/>
    <title>Reason for Referral</title>
    <text><paragraph>Please evaluate and advise on occupational exposure to radiation and chronic radiodermatitis. [S]</paragraph><paragraph>Urgent hematology referral for pancytopenia with a low reticulocyte count, for bone marrow aspirate and biopsy, cytogenetics, and PNH testing. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
